#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.0.1.rst:4
msgid "v1.0.1-beta"
msgstr "v1.0.1-beta"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.0.1.rst:6
msgid ""
"v1.0.1-beta is a tiny stabilization beta: it fixes desktop-IDE connection "
"compatibility with the Windows backend, increases the IDE connect delay, and"
" combines the lock and header into a single request. There are **no firmware"
" Python API changes** — v1.0.0-beta scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"v1.0.1-beta adalah beta stabilisasi kecil: memperbaiki kompatibilitas "
"koneksi IDE desktop dengan backend Windows, meningkatkan penundaan koneksi "
"IDE, dan menggabungkan kunci dan header menjadi satu permintaan. **Tidak ada"
" perubahan Python API firmware** — skrip v1.0.0-beta berjalan tanpa "
"perubahan."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.0.1.rst:14
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Di halaman ini"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.0.1.rst:17
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Sorotan"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.0.1.rst:19
msgid ""
"**Windows IDE fix** — corrected the init compatibility with the Windows "
"backend."
msgstr ""
"**Perbaikan IDE Windows** — memperbaiki kompatibilitas init dengan backend "
"Windows."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.0.1.rst:21
msgid ""
"**More reliable connect** — increased the IDE connect delay and combined the"
" lock + header into one request."
msgstr ""
"**Koneksi lebih andal** — meningkatkan penundaan koneksi IDE dan "
"menggabungkan kunci + header menjadi satu permintaan."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.0.1.rst:23
msgid ""
"**No firmware API changes** — reflash and your v1.0.0-beta scripts run "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"**Tidak ada perubahan API firmware** — flash ulang dan skrip v1.0.0-beta "
"Anda berjalan tanpa perubahan."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.0.1.rst:27
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Perbaikan bug"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.0.1.rst:29
msgid ""
"Fixed the desktop-IDE ``init`` compatibility with the Windows backend, "
"increased the IDE connect delay for reliability, used a single request for "
"locking and the header, and updated tooltips."
msgstr ""
"Memperbaiki kompatibilitas ``init`` IDE desktop dengan backend Windows, "
"meningkatkan penundaan koneksi IDE untuk keandalan, menggunakan satu "
"permintaan untuk penguncian dan header, serta memperbarui tooltip."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.0.1.rst:34
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Perubahan API yang memutus kompatibilitas"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v1.0.1.rst:36
msgid ""
"v1.0.1-beta introduces **no breaking Python API changes** (the changes are "
"desktop-IDE / connection-tooling only). Scripts that ran on v1.0.0-beta run "
"unchanged — just reflash the firmware."
msgstr ""
"v1.0.1-beta tidak memperkenalkan **perubahan Python API yang memutus "
"kompatibilitas** (perubahan hanya pada IDE desktop / perkakas koneksi). "
"Skrip yang berjalan pada v1.0.0-beta berjalan tanpa perubahan — cukup flash "
"ulang firmware."
